<title>USA: Homeowners Financial says names Germain CEO.</title>
<headline>Homeowners Financial says names Germain CEO.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Homeowners Financial Corp said it appointed a new president and chief executive.</p>
<p>The company said Kenneth Germain replaced Christian Pfluger III as chief executive of Homeowners Financial and its related subsidiaries, including Developers Mortgage Corp and Evergreen Mortgage.</p>
<p>The company was not immediately able to provide further information.</p>
